WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.080
Impossible. They still had this much mana left?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.830
After casting all those spells?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Golden mana and a human familiar...

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.580
How very interesting!

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.750
GO!

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:27.630
But the same trick won't work on me twice!

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.130
They're gone?!

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:34.130
Impossible, where did they-

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.460
They used the crystals to get up here?!

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.670
A-are you sure you don't want to watch?

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:46.580
Why would I wanna watch?

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:51.580
I already know how it's gonna turn out.
No way the underclassman's winning.

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:55.880
Yeah, I know, but what if they do?!

00:00:56.330 --> 00:01:00.630
They're not gonna beat her. You know how tough she is.

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.130
They...

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.170
They...

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.000
They WON?!

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.500
Black or white? Tangled up, they turn gray

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:49.790
Everything always seems so ambiguous

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:55.710
I walk by your side as you smile, helpless

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:59.080
Admiration clear as day

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:02.460
Shining out across the endless distance

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:08.210
Cast a spell on this pitiful situation with an Abracada-Boo

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:14.330
There's a loneliness hidden beneath the darkness in your eyes

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:21.080
I wish I could embrace it with a gentle song

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:25.750
Even the whole world starts to shout it's all a lie,

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:28.580
As long as you are as you are

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:34.790
I'll sweep through with a glimmering wind and scream out the truth

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:38.380
Even if the whole world yells out that it's a sin,

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:41.170
Even if I'm all on my own

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:44.250
I want to keep learning to understand you

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:49.750
I'm on your side, I'll protect you

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:57.170
<b>A CREEPING MADNESS</b>

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:58.250
Hey, Alto!

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:01.540
Is it true you won a duel
against a member of the student council?!

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:01.960
You went after the Dragonriders, too, right?!

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:03.710
Wooow!

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:04.830
No, you've got the wrong idea...

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.080
Wha... Wha...

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.000
What the hell is THAT?!

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:13.170
I don't know why you're surprised. He defeated
a Gold Square member of the student council.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:18.420
Th-those harlots... Those brazen tramps!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:22.250
Just DAYS ago they were making fun of Alto
for being a "boring nerd"!

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:23.580
Down, girl.

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:28.330
No, do NOT tell me to stand down, Cheryl! I'll kill them!
I'll put an end to them, here and now!

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:30.380
Put the rock down, please.

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:32.080
Alto Goldfield.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.130
Professor Obsidian!

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:36.380
Could I borrow you for a moment?

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:41.920
Sir, Alto's incredible!
He beat a student council member in a duel!

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:45.460
Yes, I know. I saw the duel.

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.670
Taking out Chris was quite the impressive feat.

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.790
Oh, no, well...

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.000
However...

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:55.830
You shouldn't challenge others to duels on a whim.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:04:01.540
You won this time, but if you'd have lost,
who knows what you would have been made to do?

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:05.210
Sir, Alto didn't do it on a whim!

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:07.670
I know. He had a reason.

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:11.210
And that reason was important enough, yes?

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:13.880
Yes, sir!

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:17.670
Good.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:23.710
But do try not to overdo it, now. Understood?

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:26.880
Y-yes, sir! Thank you!

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.290
I was scared for a sec there...

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:37.880
But wow, Professor Obsidian is so cool!

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.670
I can see why all the girls fawn over him.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:44.330
Is Professor Obsidian your type too, Lilia?

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:45.960
What?

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:51.250
Of course not! How dare you imply that?!

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:01.500
The hell you doing that for?

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:04.630
If you lose, you do chores.

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:08.290
Those are the rules, and as Captain,
you better believe I'm gonna follow them.

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:10.210
Also...

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.250
I'm sorry.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:15.500
What?

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.170
Don't give me that scowl.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:23.920
You should treasure this rare little gift
from an admiring underclassman.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:26.960
Gimme that.

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:35.290
You gotta start over from the bottom, right?
Great. We're finally on the same level.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:41.130
Don't push yourself too hard.
You're gonna reopen those cuts.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:43.330
Remind me who cut me in the first place!

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.130
Vermeil...

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:04.420
Seriously, though, I mean it!
Do NOT kiss me while I'm sleeping!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:07.750
Aww, but I wanted one.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:11.830
No "but"s! And put some clothes on, too!

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:13.880
Why're you so uptight?

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:19.880
Who do you think helped you defeat, uh...
Chris, from the student council?

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:22.960
So you should let me take what I want when I can.

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:28.790
Or is it something else?
Do you hate kissing me that much?

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:31.830
No, it's not that... I just...

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:43.170
A-anyway, I think you should only
k-kiss someone you're in love with!

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:47.380
Well, then, you don't have to worry.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:48.040
Huh?

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:49.920
Because...

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:54.210
I love you a whole lot.

00:06:56.420 --> 00:06:58.830
With that settled, gimme more!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.040
HEY!

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.710
I swear... Vermeil doesn't know when to stop.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:11.790
She should've when she said
she wanted a taste of SOMETHING ELSE, too...

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:14.710
You're positively glowing this morning.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.290
You think so?

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:19.710
I love you a whole lot.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.920
N-no, no, no! That's not what she meant!

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.540
Besides, Vermeil is...

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:28.630
Alto?

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:33.380
Sorry, I'm coming!

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.290
What am I even thinking?

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:37.380
Still...

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:41.920
Can a demon really fall in love with a human?

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:47.830
Can a demon fall in love with a human?

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:53.040
Yes, sir. I thought you might know the answer.

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:59.750
It's true that the demons play a vital role
in the history of magic.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:03.420
Demon-human romance, though...

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:07.540
I didn't take you for the romantic type.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.210
O-oh, no, I'm not! I just...

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:11.920
Let me think.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:17.790
There are folk stories about women
bearing the children of demons,

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:22.750
and lust-craving incubi and succubi
are said to exist as well.

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:24.540
Succubi...

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:26.460
However...

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:30.130
it's difficult to say if their actions are motivated by love.

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:31.290
S-so, uh!

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.750
Could a succubus be interested in a human man?

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:36.000
Yes.

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:43.130
But it would be because she desires his mana.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.750
Did something happen to you today?

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:02.750
Huh?

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:07.250
Oh, no... Not really. Is something wrong?

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:09.790
No, I just noticed...

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:13.960
you've been moving your food around but not eating.

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:17.420
Not sure why you're not hungry, but I'll eat it if you won't!

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:18.130
Vermeil!

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:24.630
Look, I-I-I... Gosh, how to put it...

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.580
You ARE acting strange today.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.500
Do you only like me because you want my mana?

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.420
What kind of question is that?

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.670
Are you only staying here...

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:41.130
...because you want to drain my mana?

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:51.500
What a silly boy you are.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:56.170
Is this why you were acting strange?
Because you worried that's all I'm after?

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:58.210
I, ah...

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:02.210
I'm... I'm sorry.

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:06.750
You don't need to apologize.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.710
But I'm curious. Why did you even start to think that?

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:16.790
Because you always try to drain my mana.

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:23.210
Well, only because I have to! I need mana to live.

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:25.960
I know, but...

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:27.170
Alto.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:40.710
See, you're doing it again!

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:45.040
Wait, what? You didn't touch my mana...

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:49.000
I should only kiss someone I love, right?

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:53.330
Besides! Why are you giving ME a hard time?!

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:54.880
What about YOU then, huh?!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:55.460
Huh?!
What about YOU then, huh?!<b></b>

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:01.790
C'mon. You could kiss ME sometimes, you know.

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:09.040
I...

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:11.420
I can't today!

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:18.880
Demons are so mean!

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:25.960
You're glowing even brighter than usual.

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:27.130
You think so?

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.880
Professor Obsidian!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:37.750
Hey, uh! Sorry about that random question yesterday!

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:43.210
Don't mention it. I'm a teacher.
Answering your questions is part of my job.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:46.460
But I'm curious as to why you asked me that.

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:49.290
O-oh...

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:53.170
I, uh! I was just kinda curious!

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:58.000
Well, I'm glad everything seems to have worked out.
You seemed worried.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:58.750
Huh?

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:02.540
When you left yesterday, you looked like
you were on the verge of death.

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:05.080
I'm glad you're feeling better today.

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:11.540
Demon or human, romance is not easy on the heart.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:15.040
Do you have a special someone?

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:22.670
U-uh, I think I'm still not ready for that just yet.

00:12:23.420 --> 00:12:27.040
Is that so? Regardless, do be careful.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:32.790
Every woman is a fiesty little demon.

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:43.000
Agree, make fun of me, just say something.
Don't leave me hanging here!

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:54.460
Professor? You wanted to see me?

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:56.920
Yes, there you are.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:01.960
You see, I need you to do something for me.

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.420
Do... what?

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:05.460
Yes.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:10.250
Something very important that only you can do for me.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:14.790
Um, Professor!

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:17.710
I-I really, really like you...

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:21.630
I know.

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:25.710
I love you, too.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.080
Hey, did you hear the rumor?

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:53.420
They found one of the fourth-years'
rooms frozen over with ice!

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:54.210
No way!

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:56.000
What's that all about?

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:59.170
The student inside's still alive, but she's still in a coma.

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:00.420
That's so scary!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.460
<b>STUDENT COUNCIL</b>

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.460
<b>OFFICE</b>

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:07.790
<b>STUDENT COUNCIL</b>

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:07.790
<b>VICE PRESIDENT</b>

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:05.210
A student in a coma?

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:07.790
<b>RYUGA SHINOUJI</b>

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:07.500
Not again.

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:10.040
That makes the fourth one this year.

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:11.040
Who was it this time?

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:20.960
Emma Abelein, a fourth-year Silver Square
specializing in ice magic.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:26.540
It took five people, including the dorm prefect,
to break down the door using hammers.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:26.580
<b>DUELING COMMITTEE</b>

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:26.580
<b>CHAIR</b>

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.580
<b>JESSICA SCHWARTZ</b>

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:32.960
The walls of the room were coated in thick ice.
It took two hours to extract the student.

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:37.880
How curious. Ice magic is extremely mana-inefficient.

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:43.500
A Silver Square would not possess the mana
to create ice that thick.

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:50.380
This makes the third Silver Square
that's fallen into a coma. It cannot be by coincidence.

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.250
Which means someone must be behind it.

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:57.290
Our President is especially troubled by this news.

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:03.330
With how empathetic she is,
she must be in great pain from her shattered heart.

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:07.920
Without knowing the cause or culprit,
there is little we can do.

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:09.210
For the time being...

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:10.250
Shinouji.

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:14.250
The President is in great pain.

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:21.580
Understood. I can't promise anything,
but I will do what I can.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:30.670
She's obsessed with her.

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:35.250
Surely the Silver Square's power merely ran amok.

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:41.290
All right! Hold still, please!

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.500
I meant to ask this before,

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.630
but why do you own one of these?

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:46.750
Huh? Oh.

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:50.250
So I can measure my height every day.

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:52.500
Oh, Alto.

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:57.880
Wh-what?! It makes sense!
I'm getting a little taller every day!

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.880
Uh-huh, sure you are.

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:03.330
So, how much taller am I?

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:05.080
Do you want me to curl up and cry?

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:12.080
This is turning into a real downer.
Why are they making me write this stupid report?

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:17.670
All right, class, are you getting to be friends
with your familiars?

00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:22.250
Today, we talked about lots of different types
of familiars and their main features.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:27.290
I'm sure many of you learned
something new about your own familiars!

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:32.540
I wish... Not like they'd talk about demons in this class.

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:40.040
On that note, I'd like you all
to write a report about your familiars!

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:41.040
Huh?!

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:45.380
Be sure to follow the guide on your handout.

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:48.130
A... a report?!

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:50.710
Start with their height and weight,

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:55.170
then list their features, their daily activities,
and their favorite foods.

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:58.880
Go into as much depth as you possibly can!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:11.170
Well, there are plenty of non-demon parts of you
I can measure, so let's get that done...

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:14.540
Why are you getting naked?!

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:17.460
Why? You have to measure me, don't you?

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:19.880
We wouldn't want my clothes to get in the way.

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:21.790
W-w-w-well, sure, but...

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:24.130
Please, why are you so flustered?

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:25.460
You need to for your homework, right?

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:27.460
Hey!

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:32.750
Make sure you measure every last nook and cranny.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:38.040
S-stop it! Don't! Please, don't!

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:41.080
Um, maybe we shouldn't be doing this...

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.580
Shh! Quiet!

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:48.130
You heard what kind of report we have to write!
My Alto is in danger! Don't you care?!

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:50.420
H-honestly, no, not really.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:53.500
Besides, something is off about her!

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:56.630
I'm not going to let her pull the wool over my eyes
with her "human familiar" drivel!

00:17:58.330 --> 00:17:59.540
Oh, how'd it go?!

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:04.460
Uh-huh. Uh-huh.

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:07.960
WHAT?!

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.630
That conniving whore!

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:14.130
Just you watch! Today's the day
I expose that harlot for who she really is!

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:18.040
Sure, but this is the boy's dorm.
How are you getting in there?

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:22.580
Oh, Cheryl. Whoever do you think I am?

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:26.960
With this invisibility potion, I've nothing to fear!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:31.210
Then I can use this copied key to get straight to Alto!

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:33.880
Wh-why do you have one of those?

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:36.380
Cheryl, you stay out here and watch my clothes.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:37.540
All right.

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:39.670
Down the hatch!

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:47.290
C'mon, you have to pull it tight,
or the numbers will be off.

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:51.130
I-I know! Raise your arms for me, all right?!

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:52.670
All right.

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:55.500
Do I even need to put her bust size down?

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:59.080
Could you NOT make weird noises?!

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:01.250
I swear...

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:21.580
Right, now I just need to do your legs,
so please put your clothes back on!

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:22.630
Aww...

00:19:22.630 --> 00:19:23.790
Don't 'aww' me!

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:27.540
You're going to have to write what "type" I am.
What will you put?

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:33.630
I don't really have a choice.
I'll just put that you're a human.

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:37.880
No way I could get away with putting down the truth.

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:42.540
Oh, I also need your head size,
so could you get rid of everything?

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:43.460
You got it.

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:49.080
You need to be more careful, Vermeil.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:51.580
What if someone found out what you really were?

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:54.250
Please try a little harder to hide it.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:19:59.580
H-hold on!

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:07.630
Not that one...

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:14.380
Let's see, it was around here...

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:16.710
Wait...

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:19.000
No!

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.790
Yep, this is the one!

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:36.170
You know, you've grown quite a bit recently.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:37.960
How so?

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:43.670
Well, you took out that Gold girl
and moved one step closer to your goal.

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:48.080
I hope so.

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:52.790
They don't give out Gold Squares
just for sheer power alone.

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:57.630
It's awarded for accomplishments in magical research.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:00.750
Chris was strong, though.

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:06.750
The whole time we were dueling,
I felt like she was going easy on us.

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:11.130
If she'd come at us with everything she had,
we probably wouldn't have won.

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:14.710
You may have a point there.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:19.000
But don't worry, I'll always try to win any duel.

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:23.920
With you by my side, I don't ever want to taste defeat!

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:25.880
I-is that so?

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:26.460
Yep!

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:31.580
Oh, for "Things It Likes," can I just write "sweets"?

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:33.290
Huh? Oh, sure.

00:21:33.670 --> 00:21:35.330
It's that late already?!

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:37.920
Vermeil, we need to go shopping!

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:39.250
Right!

00:21:46.830 --> 00:21:48.250
Vermeil!

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:49.960
Coming!

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:55.290
<b>Things It Likes: Sweets</b>

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:55.290
<b>AND ALTO</b>

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:04.420
I-impossible. How?!

00:22:15.630 --> 00:22:22.580
Does it get easier with time for the immortal?

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:33.290
If I was born normal, if I become normal, can I stay close?

00:22:33.880 --> 00:22:38.710
With the children, we link our arms

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:43.920
Make a circle and sing a song

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:50.670
Knowing there was no chair for me all along

00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:55.960
You locked me into the dark, I'm your preserved flower

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:59.630
The world is too slow to understand

00:22:59.630 --> 00:23:03.210
Not all blossoms spark, And spikes may be sharp

00:23:03.330 --> 00:23:07.750
They only want to see the beautiful parts

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:11.130
Sitting in a shower of scarlet rain

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:15.460
It all used to be ours, I'm counting the hours

00:23:15.460 --> 00:23:18.920
Hours that stood between us like a river

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:20.920
Once I crawled through the water

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:26.460
All I ever knew have become distant past
